Package: libmcpl@SOMAJOR@
Section: libs
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: ${shlibs:Depends}, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Monte Carlo Particle Lists (library)
 MCPL is a binary file format for lists of particle state information, for
 storing particles and exchanging them between Monte Carlo simulation codes.
 .
 This package contains the shared library.

Package: libmcpl-dev
Section: libdevel
Architecture: any
Multi-Arch: same
Depends: libmcpl@SOMAJOR@ (= ${binary:Version}), zlib1g-dev, ${misc:Depends}
Description: Monte Carlo Particle Lists (headers)
 MCPL is a binary file format for lists of particle state information, for
 storing particles and exchanging them between Monte Carlo simulation codes.
 .
 This package contains the C and C++ headers and CMake configuration files.

